5,0,1,talk,Servas,,"Good day to you all. It is a pleasure to be in such fine company, though the circumstances are quite mysterious. Shall we begin by introducing ourselves and our thoughts?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Misaki,,"I'll keep it brief. I'm Misaki. I don't have any leads yet, as it's only the first day, but I'll be observing everyone's reactions closely.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,May,,"Hello everyone! I'm May. I'm sure we're all feeling a bit tense, but let's keep it lively! I'm looking forward to seeing who among us is hiding a little secret.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I am Jonathan. I believe a quiet, observant approach will serve us best. Let us listen to one another and see what truths emerge from the silence.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hi everyone! I'm Sakura! This is like a big mystery game, isn't it? I'm super excited to find the werewolf! I'll be watching everyone very, very closely!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Servas,,"It is heartening to see such diverse perspectives. @Jonathan, your preference for silence is wise, but perhaps we should encourage those who are more hesitant to share their initial impressions?","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Misaki,,I don't have any specific impressions yet. I'm simply waiting to see if anyone's behavior contradicts their words as the conversation progresses.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,May,,"You're so serious, Misaki! Where's the fun in that? I think we should all be a bit more open. Maybe someone wants to admit they're feeling nervous?","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I am not particularly nervous, May. I simply find that the most revealing clues often hide in the gaps between words rather than in the words themselves.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,"Gaps between words? That sounds like a magic trick! I'm not nervous at all, just really curious! Do you think the werewolf is someone who talks a lot or someone who stays quiet?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Servas,,"That is a fascinating question, Sakura. In my experience, both the boisterous and the silent can hide a secret. We must remain mindful of both the noise and the stillness.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Servas. Whether someone is overly enthusiastic or unusually quiet, both can be masks. We should focus on consistency.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,May,,"Consistency is a bit boring, don't you think? I'm more interested in the sparks! Though, I must say, Sakura's excitement is almost too cute to be suspicious. Right, Sakura?","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Indeed, innocence can be a powerful shield. However, we must remember that in this game, the most unlikely candidates are often the ones we should examine most carefully.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, are you saying I'm suspicious, Jonathan? That's not fair! I'm just happy to be here! But you're right, the most unlikely person could be the wolf... that's what makes it a mystery!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Servas,,"As we conclude our first day, let us carry this spirit of curiosity and caution into the night. I believe we have all established our presence; now, we wait for the truth to reveal itself.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Misaki,,"I will continue to observe. Good night, everyone.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,May,,"Good night, everyone! Sleep tight, and I hope we all wake up tomorrow morning. Sweet dreams!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"May be right about the dreams, but let us hope the morning brings us clarity rather than sorrow. Good night.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Nighty-night! I'm going to dream about catching the werewolf red-handed! See you all tomorrow!,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
