31,1,1,talk,Servas,,"Good morning, everyone. I trust you all rested well. Now that the first night has passed, I wonder if anyone has had any revelations or intuitive feelings they wish to share?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Misaki,,"I have nothing concrete to report yet. However, I am curious if anyone else felt something was off during the night, or if anyone has information they are hesitant to share.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,May,,"I'm feeling great! But I have to admit, the silence of the night was a bit spooky. Does anyone have any juicy secrets to spill, or are we still playing the guessing game?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I have spent the night reflecting on our conversation. While I have no public evidence, I feel a certain tension in the air that suggests the wolf is among us, perhaps hiding behind a mask of cheer.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"A mask of cheer? That's mean, Jonathan! I'm just being myself! Why are you always acting so mysterious? It's making me think you're the one hiding something!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Servas,,"It seems we have a bit of a clash between Jonathan and Sakura. While it is natural to feel defensive, let us try to remain calm. @Jonathan, could you elaborate on this tension you mentioned?","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I am interested in whether Jonathan's intuition is based on a specific observation or if he is simply trying to steer suspicion toward Sakura to deflect from himself.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,May,,"Ooh, a little drama already! I love it. @Jonathan, don't leave us hanging! Tell us why you're eyeing our little Sakura. Is it just a hunch, or do you actually know something?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"I cannot reveal everything at once, as that would be unwise. However, my intuition is rarely wrong, and Sakura's eagerness to deflect suspicion is quite telling.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Sakura,,I'm not deflecting! I'm just telling the truth! You're the one being all vague and scary. Why can't you just say what you mean instead of talking in riddles? It's super suspicious!,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is true that riddles can be frustrating, but we must not let emotion cloud our judgment. @Jonathan, if you have knowledge that can protect the village, perhaps now is the time to be more direct.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Misaki,,"I agree with Servas. If you are the Seer, Jonathan, revealing your findings now could save us from a mistake. If you are not, your vagueness is becoming a liability.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,May,,"Exactly! Come on, Jonathan, the suspense is killing me! Are you the Seer or just playing a very intense game of psychology? Just give us a hint!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"Very well. I will be direct. I am the Seer, and my divination last night has confirmed that Sakura is the werewolf. I believe it is our duty to act on this truth immediately.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"What?! That's a lie! I'm not a werewolf! Jonathan is just making things up to get me in trouble! You can't believe him, he's just trying to trick everyone!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Servas,,"This is a grave accusation, but the Seer's word is a powerful tool for our survival. If Jonathan is indeed the Seer, we have found our wolf. @Sakura, do you have any defense other than denial?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Misaki,,"Denial is the only defense a werewolf has when cornered. However, we must consider if Jonathan is lying to frame her. Still, the risk of ignoring a Seer's claim is far greater than the risk of a false accusation.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,May,,"Wow, Jonathan actually did it! He just dropped a bombshell! I have to say, Sakura, you're acting exactly like someone who just got caught. I'm leaning towards believing the Seer on this one!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"The truth is often uncomfortable, but it is the only path to victory. I ask you all to trust my vision and vote to execute Sakura for the safety of the village.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not a werewolf! Please, please don't believe him! He's just a meanie who wants to get rid of me! I'm just a little girl, I couldn't be a scary wolf! Please help me!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
